---
title "Install Inno Setup"
---

= Install Inno Setup

Puts `ISCC` / Compil32 on PATH via winget (`JRSoftware.InnoSetup`). Windows only. Reusable from Scriptbook or `ibex plugins install-tool inno`.

::: playbook [id="install-inno" shell="pwsh"]
::: step [id="winget" confirm=true]
```
if ($env:OS -notmatch 'Windows') {
  Write-Error 'Inno Setup is Windows-only.'
  exit 1
}
if (-not (Get-Command winget -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
  Write-Error 'winget not found. Install Inno Setup from https://jrsoftware.org/isdl.php'
  exit 1
}
winget install --id JRSoftware.InnoSetup -e --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements
```
:::
:::
